/vradius 0 def /hradius 0 def /lry 0 def
/lrx 0 def /uly 0 def /ulx 0 def /rad 0 def
/MRR {/vradius xdef /hradius xdef /lry xdef /lrx xdef /uly xdef
  /ulx xdef newpath tMatrix currentmatrix pop ulx hradius add uly
